title: "VeloMetric: An iOS Application for Tracking Road Bike Component Wear"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-10
url: "https://github.com/yourusername/velometric"
repository-code: "https://github.com/yourusername/velometric"
abstract: >
  VeloMetric is an iOS application designed to track the wear and tear of road bike components. By logging rides and distances, the app provides cyclists with data-driven insights into the lifespan of their bike parts (e.g., chains, tires, brake pads), facilitating timely maintenance and improving safety and performance.
keywords:
  - iOS
  - cycling
  - maintenance
  - sports-tech
